T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Purpose of encryption) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CivicNet uses cryptography solely to protect **private chat message content** between users) Tj
T*
(who have been matched for community help requests.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Encryption is used for:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(? Confidentiality of chat message payloads) Tj
T*
(? Wrapping per-conversation symmetric keys for conversation participants) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Encryption is **not** used for:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(? Digital rights management \(DRM\)) Tj
T*
(? Proprietary or unpublished cryptographic protocols) Tj
T*
(? Concealing malware or circumventing security controls) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Cryptographic algorithms) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(All algorithms are **industry-standard** and published by recognized standards bodies.) Tj
T*
(CivicNet does **not** implement proprietary or non-standard cryptography.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Use  |  Algorithm  |  Key size / params  |  Standard ) Tj
T*
(  ----- | ----------- | ------------------- | ----------) Tj
T*
(   Chat message encryption  |  AES in CBC mode  |  256-bit key, 128-bit IV  |  NIST FIPS 197 /) Tj
T*
(ISO/IEC 18033-3 ) Tj
T*
(   Conversation key wrap  |  RSA-OAEP  |  2048-bit RSA, OAEP with SHA-256  |  PKCS #1 v2.2 /) Tj
T*
(IETF RFC 8017 ) Tj
T*
(   Transport to backend  |  TLS \(HTTPS\)  |  As negotiated by iOS  |  IETF TLS ? Apple OS) Tj
T*
(networking ) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Legacy dual-read \(migration only\): older messages may still be decrypted with a former) Tj
T*
(app-wide AES-256-CBC key during a limited migration window. New messages use per-conversation) Tj
T*
(keys only.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(---) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Where cryptography is implemented) Tj
T*
() Tj
