T*
() Tj
T*
(? Algorithms used are **standard** \(AES, RSA-OAEP, SHA-256, TLS\).) Tj
T*
(? No proprietary, unpublished, or non-standard cryptographic algorithms are used.) Tj
T*
(? Per Apple?s matrix for industry-standard algorithms not limited to Apple OS encryption, this) Tj
T*
(declaration supports App Store Connect export compliance review \(French encryption declaration) Tj
T*
(path when distributing in France\).) Tj
T*
(? A US CCATS filing is **not** claimed as required for this standard-algorithm use case unless) Tj
T*
(Apple?s questionnaire explicitly requests one.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
